<p>What I have is a <code>GridLayout</code> that contains 9 <code>ImageView</code>s. The source can be found here: <a href="https://github.com/selmanon/apps-for-android/blob/master/Photostream/src/com/google/android/photostream/GridLayout.java" rel="noreferrer">Romain Guys's Grid Layout</a>.</p>

