<p>This is the very simple activity that I'm trying to get the <code>fling</code> detection to work for: <a href="http://code.google.com/p/miffed/source/browse/GUI/src/uk/ac/ic/doc/gea05/miffed/gui/SelectFilterActivity.java?r=210" rel="noreferrer">SelectFilterActivity (Adapted from photostream)</a>.</p>

